          "quote": "U2 ATtiny45-20P ... 5 AREF/PB0 ... 6 PB1 ... 7 PB2 (sheet /, right tile)"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "If the U3 SMD footprint is populated, the MCU sees/drives SDA, PWM and SCK on the wrong GPIO pins, so firmware written for the ATtiny13/45 pinout will not control the fan or the I2C/SPI interface correctly.",
      "confidence": 0.78
    },
    {
      "category": "wrong_component_type",
      "components": [
        "D1",
        "R6"
      ],
